{"scene_id": "pt_pygmalion_16", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_pygmalion_16.fountain", "heading": "INT. PYGMALION - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "HIGGINS", "names": ["HIGGINS"], "gender": "f", "first": 1, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 1, "name": "MISS EYNSFORD HILL", "names": ["MISS EYNSFORD HILL", "MRS. EYNSFORD HILL"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 2, "name": "MRS", "names": ["MRS"], "gender": "?", "first": 8, "spoke": 12}, {"id": 3, "name": "LIZA", "names": ["LIZA"], "gender": "?", "first": 31, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 4, "name": "PICKERING", "names": ["PICKERING"], "gender": "?", "first": 36, "spoke": 1}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. PYGMALION - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I suppose I am, you know.", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Uproariously.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 3, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ha, ha!", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "MISS EYNSFORD HILL [who considers Higgins quite eligible matrimonially] I sympathize.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "I haven\u2019t any small talk.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "If people would only be frank and say what they really think!", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "HIGGINS [relapsing into gloom] Lord forbid!", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "EYNSFORD HILL", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "taking up her daughter\u2019s cue.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "But why?", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What they think they ought to think is bad enough, Lord knows; but what they really think would break up the whole show. Do you suppose it would be really agreeable if I were to come out now with what I really think?", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "MISS EYNSFORD HILL [gaily] Is it so very cynical?", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Cynical! Who the dickens said it was cynical? I mean it wouldn\u2019t be decent.", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "EYNSFORD HILL", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "seriously.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Oh! I\u2019m sure you don\u2019t mean that, Mr. Higgins.", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You see, we\u2019re all savages, more or less. We\u2019re supposed to be civilized and cultured\u2014to know all about poetry and philosophy and art and science, and so on; but how many of us know even the meanings of these names?", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "To Miss Hill.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What do you know of poetry?", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "To Mrs. Hill.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What do you know of science?", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Indicating Freddy.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What does he know of art or science or anything else? What the devil do you imagine I know of philosophy?", "name": "HIGGINS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "HIGGINS", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "warningly.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Or of manners, Henry?", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "THE PARLOR-MAID [opening the door] Miss Doolittle. [She withdraws].", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "HIGGINS [rising hastily and running to Mrs. Higgins] Here she is, mother. [He stands on tiptoe and makes signs over his mother\u2019s head to Eliza to indicate to her which lady is her hostess].", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Eliza, who is exquisitely dressed, produces an impression of such remarkable distinction and beauty as she enters that they all rise, quite flustered.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Guided by Higgins\u2019s signals, she comes to Mrs. Higgins with studied grace.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "LIZA [speaking with pedantic correctness of pronunciation and great beauty of tone] How do you do, Mrs. Higgins? [She gasps slightly in making sure of the H in Higgins, but is quite successful].", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Higgins told me I might come.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "HIGGINS", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "cordially.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Quite right: I\u2019m very glad indeed to see you.", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How do you do, Miss Doolittle?", "name": "PICKERING", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "LIZA [shaking hands with him] Colonel Pickering, is it not?", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I feel sure we have met before, Miss Doolittle. I remember your eyes.", "name": "MRS. EYNSFORD HILL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How do you do?", "name": "LIZA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "She sits down on the ottoman gracefully in the place just left vacant by Higgins.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "EYNSFORD HILL", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "introducing.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My daughter Clara.", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How do you do?", "name": "LIZA", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "CLARA [impulsively] How do you do? [She sits down on the ottoman beside Eliza, devouring her with her eyes].", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "FREDDY [coming to their side of the ottoman] I\u2019ve certainly had the pleasure.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "EYNSFORD HILL", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "introducing.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My son Freddy.", "name": "MRS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}